---
manual: slot.style_getter_methods
lines: [2378, 2380]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  $slot = stack width: "50%", height: 100, scroll: true, displace_left: 3 do
    para "styled"
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_equal true, $slot.scroll, "every style has a method of the same name"
assert_equal 100, $slot.height
assert_equal 3, $slot.displace_left
assert_equal 200, $slot.width, "and width answers in pixels, not with the \"50%\" it was given"
